<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-04-21T07:42:12+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Tue, 21 Apr 2026 07:42:12 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA["She’s for the streets": Laura Loomer’s latest attack pulls Candace Owens’ family into escalating political feud]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130404895.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The feud between Candace Owens and Laura Loomer has escalated, with Loomer targeting Owens’ father-in-law, Michael Farmer. The conflict turned personal after Owens referenced Loomer’s husband, prompting a sharp response. Loomer’s remarks have drawn attention to Farmer’s background, though neither he nor Owens has publicly addressed the situation as the controversy continues to grow online.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/shes-for-the-streets-laura-loomers-latest-attack-pulls-candace-owens-family-into-escalating-political-feud/articleshow/130404895.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/shes-for-the-streets-laura-loomers-latest-attack-pulls-candace-owens-family-into-escalating-political-feud/articleshow/130404895.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-21T06:00:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Barsha Dutta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130404895,imgsize-45228.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Disturbing video surfaces as Klaudia Zakrzewska hit by Gabrielle Carrington Mercedes after clash outside London nightclub]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130404827.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Klaudia Zakrzewska, known as Klaudia Glam, is in critical condition after being hit by a car outside a London nightclub. Video shows a fight with Gabrielle Carrington before the crash. Carrington has been arrested, police confirmed. Two others were injured. Authorities are asking witnesses to come forward as the investigation continues.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/disturbing-video-surfaces-as-klaudia-zakrzewska-hit-by-gabrielle-carrington-mercedes-after-clash-outside-london-nightclub/articleshow/130404827.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/disturbing-video-surfaces-as-klaudia-zakrzewska-hit-by-gabrielle-carrington-mercedes-after-clash-outside-london-nightclub/articleshow/130404827.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-21T05:27:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130404825,imgsize-833261.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Twin S? Rapper linked in rumours after Klaudia Glam injured in Gabrielle Carrington London crash case]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130404600.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Klaudia Glam was injured in a serious London incident involving Gabrielle Carrington, who has been arrested. Police have not confirmed any death or motive yet. Rumours linking UK rapper Twin S to the fight are spreading online, but there is no official proof. Authorities continue to investigate while many claims on social media remain unverified.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-twin-s-rapper-linked-in-rumours-after-klaudia-glam-injured-in-gabrielle-carrington-london-crash-case/articleshow/130404600.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/who-is-twin-s-rapper-linked-in-rumours-after-klaudia-glam-injured-in-gabrielle-carrington-london-crash-case/articleshow/130404600.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-21T03:53:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehjal Gupta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130404598,imgsize-932013.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian migration agent banned for five years in Australia for lying on visa applications]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130402258.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-migration-agent-banned-for-five-years-in-australia-for-lying-on-visa-applications-not-a-person-of-integrity/articleshow/130402258.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-migration-agent-banned-for-five-years-in-australia-for-lying-on-visa-applications-not-a-person-of-integrity/articleshow/130402258.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-21T02:24:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130402484,imgsize-45528.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Twitch streamer PlaqueBoyMax reveals he got a vasectomy after pregnancy scare, sparks online debate]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130402466.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Twitch streamer PlaqueBoyMax underwent a vasectomy at 23 following a pregnancy scare, seeking a permanent solution to avoid future fatherhood. He described the procedure as simple and quick, emphasizing his desire for peace of mind to focus on his career. The decision has sparked widespread online debate regarding his young age and the permanence of the choice.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-plaqueboymax-reveals-he-got-a-vasectomy-after-pregnancy-scare-sparks-online-debate/articleshow/130402466.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/twitch-streamer-plaqueboymax-reveals-he-got-a-vasectomy-after-pregnancy-scare-sparks-online-debate/articleshow/130402466.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-21T02:10:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130402464,imgsize-385887.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Kash Patel does not drink to excess': 19-page lawsuit against Atlantic for $250 million details why FBI director 'freaked out']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130402443.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/kash-patel-does-not-drink-to-excess-19-page-lawsuit-against-atlantic-for-250-million-details-why-fbi-director-freaked-out/articleshow/130402443.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/kash-patel-does-not-drink-to-excess-19-page-lawsuit-against-atlantic-for-250-million-details-why-fbi-director-freaked-out/articleshow/130402443.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-21T02:09:40+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130402455,imgsize-60540.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[HasanAbi calls out Pragmata players over family feelings, questions emotional impact of Hugh and Diana story]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130402023.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[HasanAbi reacted to Pragmata after players said the game made them think about starting a family. He questioned this reaction and shared his views during a live stream. He also raised concerns about the child-like character in the game. His comments led to mixed reactions online, with fans debating both his opinion and the game’s emotional story.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/hasanabi-calls-out-pragmata-players-over-family-feelings-questions-emotional-impact-of-hugh-and-diana-story/articleshow/130402023.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/hasanabi-calls-out-pragmata-players-over-family-feelings-questions-emotional-impact-of-hugh-and-diana-story/articleshow/130402023.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-21T00:56:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130402017,imgsize-24568.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Former streamer and singer D4vd charged with murder in shocking case of teen found dismembered in Tesla]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130402189.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Former streamer D4vd has been officially charged with capital murder in the death of 14-year-old Celeste Rivas Hernandez. Her body was discovered in a Tesla in September 2025, months after she went missing. Authorities believe D4vd may have killed her to protect his career, facing charges including child abuse and mutilation.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/former-streamer-and-singer-d4vd-charged-with-murder-in-shocking-case-of-teen-found-dismembered-in-tesla/articleshow/130402189.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/former-streamer-and-singer-d4vd-charged-with-murder-in-shocking-case-of-teen-found-dismembered-in-tesla/articleshow/130402189.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-21T01:11:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sumit Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130402181,imgsize-452637.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mother and six children die after Pennsylvania house explodes, bursts into flames]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130401998.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mother-and-six-children-die-after-pennsylvania-house-explodes-bursts-into-flames-heard-a-boom-could-feel-it/articleshow/130401998.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mother-and-six-children-die-after-pennsylvania-house-explodes-bursts-into-flames-heard-a-boom-could-feel-it/articleshow/130401998.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-21T01:02:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elem